<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>BBQ Grill Night | Hotel Royal Marina Suites Boutique</title>

<style>
:root{
  --blue:#062b4f;
  --gold:#c9a45c;
  --white:#ffffff;
  --soft:#f5f8fa;
  --text:#1f2a36;
}

*{box-sizing:border-box;}

body{
  margin:0;
  font-family:Arial, sans-serif;
  background:var(--soft);
  color:var(--text);
}

.hero-bbq{
  min-height:68vh;
  position:relative;
  overflow:hidden;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  text-align:center;
  color:white;
}

.hero-bbq img{
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  width:100%;
  height:100%;
  object-fit:cover;
  object-position:center;
}

.hero-bbq::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(
    rgba(6,43,79,0.25),
    rgba(6,43,79,0.90)
  );
  z-index:1;
}

.hero-content{
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
  padding:30px;
  max-width:850px;
}

.hero-content p{
  color:var(--gold);
  letter-spacing:4px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-size:12px;
}

.hero-content h1{
  font-family:Georgia, serif;
  font-size:50px;
  font-weight:400;
  margin:0;
}

.gold-line{
  width:80px;
  height:2px;
  background:var(--gold);
  margin:25px auto;
}

.container{
  max-width:1100px;
  margin:auto;
  padding:55px 20px;
}

.reservation-box{
  background:var(--blue);
  color:white;
  border-radius:24px;
  padding:34px;
  margin-top:-95px;
  position:relative;
  z-index:3;
  box-shadow:0 14px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
  text-align:center;
}

.reservation-box span{
  color:var(--gold);
  letter-spacing:3px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.reservation-box h2{
  font-family:Georgia, serif;
  font-size:30px;
  font-weight:400;
  margin:14px 0;
}

.reservation-box p{
  line-height:1.7;
  margin-bottom:0;
}

.intro{
  text-align:center;
  max-width:760px;
  margin:55px auto 45px;
}

.intro h2{
  font-family:Georgia, serif;
  color:var(--blue);
  font-size:34px;
  font-weight:400;
}

.intro p{
  line-height:1.7;
}

.choice-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));
  gap:26px;
}

.choice-card{
  background:white;
  border-radius:24px;
  overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  border:1px solid #e8e8e8;
}

.choice-card img{
  width:100%;
  height:210px;
  object-fit:cover;
}

.choice-content{
  padding:30px;
}

.choice-content span{
  color:var(--gold);
  letter-spacing:2px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.choice-content h3{
  font-family:Georgia, serif;
  color:var(--blue);
  font-size:27px;
  font-weight:400;
  margin:12px 0;
}

.choice-content p{
  line-height:1.7;
  font-size:14px;
}

.experience{
  margin:55px 0;
  min-height:390px;
  border-radius:24px;
  overflow:hidden;
  position:relative;
  display:flex;
  align-items:flex-end;
  color:white;
  box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

.experience img{
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  width:100%;
  height:100%;
  object-fit:cover;
}

.experience::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  inset:0;
  background:linear-gradient(
    rgba(6,43,79,0.08),
    rgba(6,43,79,0.88)
  );
  z-index:1;
}

.experience-text{
  position:relative;
  z-index:2;
  padding:42px;
  max-width:700px;
}

.experience-text span{
  color:var(--gold);
  letter-spacing:2px;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:bold;
}

.experience-text h2{
  font-family:Georgia, serif;
  font-size:34px;
  font-weight:400;
}

.experience-text p{
  line-height:1.7;
}

.notice{
  background:white;
  border-left:5px solid var(--gold);
  padding:28px;
  border-radius:18px;
  box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
}

.back{
  display:inline-block;
  margin-top:35px;
  color:var(--gold);
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:bold;
}

footer{
  background:var(--blue);
  color:white;
  text-align:center;
  padding:28px;
  font-size:14px;
}

@media(max-width:800px){
  .hero-content h1{
    font-size:37px;
  }

  .reservation-box{
    margin-top:-60px;
  }

  .experience{
    min-height:430px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<section class="hero-bbq">
  <img src="../images/bbq.jpg" alt="BBQ Grill Night">

  <div class="hero-content">
    <p>Friday Evening Experience</p>
    <h1>BBQ Grill Night</h1>
    <div class="gold-line"></div>
    <p>Every Friday · Under Reservation</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container">

  <div class="reservation-box">
    <span>Reservation Required</span>
    <h2>Every Friday Evening</h2>
    <p>
      BBQ Grill Night is available under reservation. As our products are fresh,
      occasional exceptions may be possible depending on product availability.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="intro">
    <h2>A Special Evening by the Marina</h2>
    <p>
      Enjoy a curated grill experience prepared for a relaxed Friday evening.
      Guests may choose between a vegetable, fish or meat option, subject to availability.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="choice-grid">

    <div class="choice-card">
      <img src="../images/bbq-veg.jpg" alt="Vegetable grill option">
      <div class="choice-content">
        <span>Option One</span>
        <h3>Vegetable Grill</h3>
        <p>
          A fresh vegetarian grill option designed around seasonal vegetables
          and Mediterranean flavours.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="choice-card">
      <img src="../images/bbq-fish.jpg" alt="Fish grill option">
      <div class="choice-content">
        <span>Option Two</span>
        <h3>Fish Grill</h3>
        <p>
          A fresh fish selection prepared for the grill, ideal for a lighter
          island-inspired dinner.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="choice-card">
      <img src="../images/bbq-meat.jpg" alt="Meat grill option">
      <div class="choice-content">
        <span>Option Three</span>
        <h3>Meat Grill</h3>
        <p>
          A classic grilled meat option prepared for guests who prefer a richer
          Friday evening dining experience.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="experience">
    <img src="../images/bbq-detail.jpg" alt="Grill evening experience">

    <div class="experience-text">
      <span>Marina Restaurant</span>
      <h2>An exclusive Friday grill experience</h2>
      <p>
        Designed as a relaxed evening dining experience, BBQ Grill Night brings together
        fresh ingredients, warm service and the atmosphere of Royal Marina Suites Boutique.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="notice">
    <strong>Please note</strong>
    <p>
      Reservations are recommended in advance. Availability may depend on fresh product
      supply, especially for fish and meat selections. Please contact reception or Marina
      Restaurant for confirmation.
    </p>
  </div>

  <a class="back" href="restaurant.html">← Back to Marina Restaurant</a>

</div>

<footer>
  Hotel Royal Marina Suites Boutique Lanzarote
</footer>

</body>
</html>
